      "content": "rebuilding sounds exhausting. i don't even have the energy to try. honestly, if the person who actually mattered is gone, what's the point of the rebuild? why bother trying to form this \"new\" thing when the real me is already deleted? it feels like i'm just dragging around a corpse. it would be so much easier to just stop dragging it around, you know? to just let the rest of me go too.",
